<title>POLAND: Agros new issue oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Agros new issue oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:	     Agros Holding SA</p>
<p> Type of Issue:    new shares</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Offered:		  2,425,000</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Subscribed:	     4,503,663</p>
<p> Price (PLN)	 70</p>
<p>TRANCHES	 NO OF SHARES   NO OF SHARES    ORDERS</p>
<p>		   SUBSCRIBED     ALLOTED	   REDUCTION (PCT)</p>
<p>Selected</p>
<p>institutions   3,910,425	1,831,762	 53.16 (average)</p>
<p>Open		 145,570	  145,570	  none</p>
<p>Rights	     447,668	  447,668	  none</p>
<p>NOTE - Agros said it moved 154,430 shares from the open tranche and 442,332 shares from the rights tranche to institutional tranche.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
